    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Exactly. That's exactly what i feel. It feels like i'm just performing a role in a play that ended a long time ago. I'm just existing, but the \"me\" that mattered is gone. It feels so heavy just to exist like this. Like i'm dragging around a corpse. Does it ever stop feeling like this? Or is this just... what life is now?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
