      "content": "It's not something that will magically stop, it's just a constant reminder of the life you've lost. The pain and the emptiness will always be there, a constant companion that you'll have to learn to live with. It's not a burden that you can just leave behind, it's a part of who you are now. You'll have to find a way to accept it, to learn to live with the weight of your own loss.",
